      "assumption": "Reviewed multi-producer production and installed/used systems represent ordinary industry and residents, and persist to cutoff. Talent and execution constraints remain material after employer services and commercialization assistance; if this materiality inference fails, reconsider 80 or unknown rather than cap at 60 for missing high-tier data.",
