      "assumption": "Ordinary median-income residents can usually fund and use travel, destination eligibility and accounts; the reviewed routes persist to cutoff and ordinary communications remain usable. Legal work eligibility is not a job or housing guarantee; transport/common failure and household communication remain open.",
